public/demos/

# Generated by scripts/generate-platform-matrix.mjs, which both `build` and `start`
# run first — so nothing ever reads an ungenerated copy, and there is no committed
# copy to go stale. NOT committed, unlike its siblings coverage.ts / adwaita-tokens.ts:
# those derive from tracked repo files and are identical on every machine, while this
# one credits "artifact committed" from a `prebuilds/` directory PRESENT in the working
# tree. node-gi's is gitignored, so a developer who has ever staged one gets a `✓`
# where a clean checkout gets `○` — measured. A committed copy would be one
# workstation's answer, published.
src/data/platform-matrix.ts
